 "final_text": "Done. Here's the reconciliation summary for the **Operating Account (USMF-OPER), 24\u201328 Feb 2026**:\n\n---\n\n### Matched (2)\n| Ref | Amount | Description |\n|-----|--------|-------------|\n| **PMT-2101** | $12,400.00 | Alpine Ski House Wire |\n| **PMT-2103** | $22,000.00 | Coho Winery Wire |\n\n### Discrepancy (1)\n| Ref | Bank | Books | \u0394 |\n|-----|------|-------|---|\n| **PMT-2102** | $8,105.75 | $8,150.75 | **$45.00** |\n\nCity Power & Light ACH \u2014 the ERP shows $45 more than what actually hit the bank. Likely a data-entry error; needs correction in the subledger.\n\n### Books-only (1)\n| Ref | Amount | Description |\n|-----|--------|-------------|\n| **PMT-2104** | $5,325.50 | Check 8841 \u2014 Consolidated Messenger |\n\nPosted in ERP (Feb 27) but not on the Feb bank statement \u2014 likely still in transit (check float).\n\n### Bank-only (17)\nAll 17 DEP-7xxx / PMT-7xxx items appear on the bank statement but have **no corresponding entry in the ERP** (not in AR, AP, or GL journals). These include lockbox batches, payroll funding debits, FX conversions, wire-outs, ACH settlements, and card settlements. They need to be booked \u2014 likely via a bank reconciliation journal or by importing the statement lines.",
